WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.200
Start with an original sketch.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:34.520
Ask for one addition: a leafy twig beside the cup.

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:37.530
The cup stays. A new direction appears beside it.

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:41.830
Undo the addition and return to the original.
